#: includes/class-self-client.php:445
msgid "The licence server could not be reached. Please try again."
msgstr "Der Lizenzserver war nicht erreichbar. Bitte versuche es noch einmal."

#. translators: %d: number of seconds the website waited.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:456
#, php-format
msgid "Your website’s server waited %d seconds for an answer and got none. Usually your host or a firewall blocks outgoing connections."
msgstr "Der Server deiner Website hat %d Sekunden auf eine Antwort gewartet und keine bekommen. Meist sperrt der Hoster oder eine Firewall ausgehende Verbindungen."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:461
msgid "Your website’s server could not look up the address of the licence server (name resolution failed). That is a matter for your host (DNS)."
msgstr "Der Server deiner Website konnte die Adresse des Lizenzservers nicht auflösen (Namensauflösung fehlgeschlagen). Das ist Sache deines Hosters (DNS)."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:464
msgid "Your website’s server could not open a connection to the licence server. Usually your host or a firewall blocks outgoing connections."
msgstr "Der Server deiner Website konnte keine Verbindung zum Lizenzserver aufbauen. Meist sperrt der Hoster oder eine Firewall ausgehende Verbindungen."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:467
msgid "The secure connection failed at the certificate check. Usually the list of trusted certificates on your website’s server is out of date – your host can update it."
msgstr "Die sichere Verbindung ist an der Zertifikatsprüfung gescheitert. Meist ist die Liste vertrauenswürdiger Zertifikate auf dem Server deiner Website veraltet – dein Hoster kann sie aktualisieren."

#. translators: %s: host name of the licence server, e.g. smartengin.de.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:823
#, php-format
msgid "WordPress on your website blocked the request itself – through the setting WP_HTTP_BLOCK_EXTERNAL in wp-config.php or through a plugin. To allow it, add %s to WP_ACCESSIBLE_HOSTS."
msgstr "WordPress auf deiner Website hat die Anfrage selbst gesperrt – über die Einstellung WP_HTTP_BLOCK_EXTERNAL in der wp-config.php oder über ein Plugin. Zum Freigeben %s in WP_ACCESSIBLE_HOSTS eintragen."

#. translators: 1: address of the licence server, e.g. https://smartengin.de, 2: port number.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:477
#, php-format
msgid "Your host needs to allow outgoing connections to %1$s (port %2$d)."
msgstr "Dein Hoster muss ausgehende Verbindungen zu %1$s (Port %2$d) erlauben."

#. translators: 1: address of the licence server, e.g. https://smartengin.de, 2: port number.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:484
#, php-format
msgid "Licence server: %1$s (port %2$d)."
msgstr "Lizenzserver: %1$s (Port %2$d)."

#. translators: %s: the original technical error text, e.g. "cURL error 28: Operation timed out ...".
#: includes/class-self-client.php:501
#, php-format
msgid "(Technical detail: %s)"
msgstr "(Technische Angabe: %s)"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:837
msgid "Please enter a licence key."
msgstr "Bitte gib einen Lizenzschlüssel ein."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code, e.g. 403 or 503.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:885
#, php-format
msgid "Activation failed. (The licence server answered with HTTP status %d.)"
msgstr "Aktivierung fehlgeschlagen. (Der Lizenzserver hat mit HTTP-Status %d geantwortet.)"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:889
msgid "Activation failed."
msgstr "Aktivierung fehlgeschlagen."

#. translators: %s: changelog URL
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1243
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1321
#, php-format
msgid "See the full changelog: %s"
msgstr "Vollständige Änderungsliste: %s"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1246
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1324
msgid "No changelog available."
msgstr "Keine Änderungsliste vorhanden."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1394
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check (SHA-256 mismatch). The update was aborted to protect your site."
msgstr "Das heruntergeladene Update hat die Echtheitsprüfung nicht bestanden (SHA-256 stimmt nicht überein). Das Update wurde abgebrochen, um deine Website zu schützen."

#. translators: 1: site host, 2: underlying error message.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1421
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be installed automatically because the licence server runs on this same site (%1$s): during an update WordPress has to download the package from the site to itself, and your host blocked that self-request (“503 Service Unavailable”). The new version is available — please install it manually via Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin, or run the licence server on a separate domain. (Technical detail: %2$s)"
msgstr "Das Update ließ sich nicht automatisch installieren, weil der Lizenzserver auf derselben Website läuft (%1$s): Bei einem Update muss WordPress das Paket von der Website zu sich selbst herunterladen, und dein Hoster hat diese Anfrage an sich selbst gesperrt („503 Service Unavailable“). Die neue Version steht bereit — bitte installiere sie von Hand über Plugins → Neues Plugin hinzufügen → Plugin hochladen, oder betreibe den Lizenzserver auf einer eigenen Domain. (Technische Angabe: %2$s)"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1442
msgid "Not allowed."
msgstr "Nicht erlaubt."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1636
msgid "This website has already used its free trial, so it receives no updates."
msgstr "Diese Website hat ihren kostenlosen Test schon genutzt und bekommt deshalb keine Updates."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1638
msgid "This website is not registered for this licence, so it receives no updates."
msgstr "Diese Website ist für diese Lizenz nicht angemeldet und bekommt deshalb keine Updates."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1701
msgid "Not activated."
msgstr "Nicht aktiviert."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1713
msgid "Active — lifetime licence."
msgstr "Aktiv — unbefristete Lizenz."

#. translators: %s: expiry date
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1717
#, php-format
msgid "Active — valid until %s."
msgstr "Aktiv — gültig bis %s."

#. translators: %s: date the premium features switch off
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1729
#, php-format
msgid "Expired — the subscription has ended. Premium features stay on until %s, then they switch off. Please renew."
msgstr "Abgelaufen — das Abo ist beendet. Die Premium-Funktionen bleiben bis %s an, danach schalten sie sich ab. Bitte verlängere es."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1734
msgid "Expired — the subscription has ended and premium features are switched off. Renew it to switch them back on."
msgstr "Abgelaufen — das Abo ist beendet, und die Premium-Funktionen sind abgeschaltet. Verlängere es, um sie wieder einzuschalten."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1736
msgid "Expired — the plugin keeps working, but updates are paused. Please renew."
msgstr "Abgelaufen — das Plugin läuft weiter, aber Updates sind ausgesetzt. Bitte verlängere die Lizenz."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1740
msgid "This licence is no longer active."
msgstr "Diese Lizenz ist nicht mehr aktiv."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1743
msgid "This licence key was not recognised."
msgstr "Dieser Lizenzschlüssel wurde nicht erkannt."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1746
msgid "Status unknown."
msgstr "Status unbekannt."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1762
msgid "Licence"
msgstr "Lizenz"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1771
msgid "Licence key"
msgstr "Lizenzschlüssel"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1779
msgid "Activate"
msgstr "Aktivieren"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1782
msgid "Deactivate"
msgstr "Deaktivieren"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:680
msgid "no answer in time (time-out)"
msgstr "keine Antwort in der vorgesehenen Zeit (Zeitüberschreitung)"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:682
msgid "the name could not be resolved (DNS)"
msgstr "der Name konnte nicht aufgelöst werden (DNS)"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:684
msgid "no connection could be opened"
msgstr "es ließ sich keine Verbindung aufbauen"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:686
msgid "the certificate check failed"
msgstr "die Zertifikatsprüfung ist gescheitert"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:688
msgid "blocked by WordPress itself"
msgstr "von WordPress selbst gesperrt"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:690
msgid "another error"
msgstr "ein anderer Fehler"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:703
msgid "The connection works. Please activate your licence again now."
msgstr "Die Verbindung steht. Bitte aktiviere die Lizenz jetzt noch einmal."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:705
msgid "The licence server can be reached, so activating should work now. WordPress.org could not be reached from your server — that does not affect your licence, but it may affect updates of WordPress itself."
msgstr "Der Lizenzserver ist erreichbar, das Aktivieren sollte also jetzt gehen. WordPress.org war von deinem Server aus nicht erreichbar — das betrifft deine Lizenz nicht, kann aber die Updates von WordPress selbst betreffen."

#. translators: 1: licence server address, 2: HTTP status code.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:709
#, php-format
msgid "Your server reached %1$s, but the answer was a refusal (HTTP status %2$d). It may come from the licence server itself or from a protection in front of it — this is usually not caused by your host. Please send the text below to the support of this plugin."
msgstr "Dein Server hat %1$s erreicht, die Antwort war aber eine Ablehnung (HTTP-Status %2$d). Sie kann vom Lizenzserver selbst kommen oder von einem Schutz davor — meist liegt das nicht an deinem Hoster. Bitte schick den Text unten an den Support dieses Plugins."

#. translators: %s: licence server address.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:716
#, php-format
msgid "Your server can reach the internet, but not %s. That is not caused by your key and not by your website. Please send the text below to your host."
msgstr "Dein Server erreicht das Internet, aber nicht %s. Das liegt nicht an deinem Schlüssel und nicht an deiner Website. Bitte schick den Text unten an deinen Hoster."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:720
msgid "Your server does not seem to be allowed to open any connections to the outside. Please send the text below to your host."
msgstr "Dein Server darf offenbar gar keine Verbindungen nach außen aufbauen. Bitte schick den Text unten an deinen Hoster."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:739
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1555
msgid "could not be resolved"
msgstr "konnte nicht aufgelöst werden"

#. translators: 1: HTTP status code, 2: duration in milliseconds.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:745
#, php-format
msgid "reached (HTTP status %1$d, %2$d ms)"
msgstr "erreicht (HTTP-Status %1$d, %2$d ms)"

#. translators: 1: short reason, e.g. "no answer in time (time-out)", 2: duration in milliseconds.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:752
#, php-format
msgid "NOT reached: %1$s (after %2$d ms)"
msgstr "NICHT erreicht: %1$s (nach %2$d ms)"

#. translators: 1: domain of the website, 2: date and time of the test.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:761
#, php-format
msgid "Connection test from the website %1$s on %2$s."
msgstr "Verbindungstest von der Website %1$s am %2$s."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:765
msgid "A plugin on this website cannot reach its licence server."
msgstr "Ein Plugin auf dieser Website erreicht seinen Lizenzserver nicht."

#. translators: 1: address, 2: port number.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:769
#, php-format
msgid "Target: %1$s (port %2$d)"
msgstr "Ziel: %1$s (Port %2$d)"

#. translators: %s: IP addresses, or "could not be resolved".
#: includes/class-self-client.php:775
#, php-format
msgid "IP address resolved by this server: %s"
msgstr "Von diesem Server aufgelöste IP-Adresse: %s"

#. translators: %s: result, e.g. "NOT reached: no answer in time (time-out) (after 10004 ms)".
#: includes/class-self-client.php:780
#, php-format
msgid "Result: %s"
msgstr "Ergebnis: %s"

#. translators: %s: the original technical error text.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:786
#, php-format
msgid "Technical detail: %s"
msgstr "Technische Angabe: %s"

#. translators: 1: address, 2: result, e.g. "reached (HTTP status 200, 120 ms)".
#: includes/class-self-client.php:793
#, php-format
msgid "For comparison, %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "Zum Vergleich %1$s: %2$s"

#. translators: %s: address of the licence server.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:800
#, php-format
msgid "Please check whether outgoing connections from this web space to %s are blocked or routed wrongly."
msgstr "Bitte prüft, ob ausgehende Verbindungen von diesem Webspace zu %s gesperrt oder falsch geleitet werden."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:803
msgid "Please also tell me the outgoing IP address of this web space (the address its requests leave from — not the address of the website itself)."
msgstr "Bitte nennt mir außerdem die ausgehende IP-Adresse dieses Webspace (die Adresse, von der seine Anfragen ausgehen — nicht die Adresse der Website selbst)."

#. translators: %s: host name of the licence server.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:806
#, php-format
msgid "And please send me the result of a traceroute from this web space to %s."
msgstr "Und bitte schickt mir das Ergebnis eines Traceroute von diesem Webspace zu %s."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1580
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1800
msgid "Help with connection problems"
msgstr "Hilfe bei Verbindungsproblemen"

#. translators: %s: date and time of the last check.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1510
#, php-format
msgid "Last check: %s"
msgstr "Letzte Prüfung: %s"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1516
msgid "You clicked again within a few seconds, so this is the result of the last check."
msgstr "Du hast innerhalb weniger Sekunden noch einmal geklickt. Darum steht hier das Ergebnis der letzten Prüfung."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1522
msgid "Target"
msgstr "Ziel"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1523
msgid "IP address"
msgstr "IP-Adresse"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1524
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Ergebnis"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1525
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Dauer"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1529
msgid "Licence server"
msgstr "Lizenzserver"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1530
msgid "WordPress.org (for comparison)"
msgstr "WordPress.org (zum Vergleich)"

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1539
#, php-format
msgid "reached (HTTP %d)"
msgstr "erreicht (HTTP %d)"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1544
msgid "not reached"
msgstr "nicht erreicht"

#. translators: %d: port number.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1551
#, php-format
msgid "port %d"
msgstr "Port %d"

#. translators: %d: duration in milliseconds.
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1560
#, php-format
msgid "%d ms"
msgstr "%d ms"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1571
#: includes/class-self-client.php:1573
msgid "Text for your host"
msgstr "Text für deinen Hoster"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1572
msgid "Send this text to your host’s support. It contains the measured values, and no licence key."
msgstr "Schick diesen Text an den Support deines Hosters. Er enthält die gemessenen Werte und keinen Lizenzschlüssel."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1575
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Kopiert"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1576
msgid "Copy text"
msgstr "Text kopieren"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1789
msgid "Connection to the licence server"
msgstr "Verbindung zum Lizenzserver"

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1790
msgid "If activating does not work, this check finds out where the connection breaks. It asks the licence server and, for comparison, WordPress.org — from the server your website runs on. Your licence key is not sent."
msgstr "Klappt das Aktivieren nicht, findet diese Prüfung heraus, wo die Verbindung abreißt. Sie fragt den Lizenzserver und zum Vergleich WordPress.org — vom Server aus, auf dem deine Website läuft. Dein Lizenzschlüssel wird dabei nicht mitgeschickt."

#: includes/class-self-client.php:1792
msgid "Check connection"
msgstr "Verbindung prüfen"
